.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation at: https://autobrr.com
.PP
Discord community: https://discord.autobrr.com
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
.B 0
Successful program execution.
.TP
.B 1
Usage, syntax or configuration file error.